## The visual hum

Some directors repeat a color until it stops reading as decoration and starts reading as pressure. The third time you see that pink, it means something it did not mean the first time.

## Repetition as memory

A motif returning is the cheapest and most reliable way a film has of telling you what its character cannot forget.
